/**
 * Spawn-time harness selection through the public paths: startSubagentRun,
 * the registered `subagent` and `subagent_resume` tools, and the registered
 * `/subagent` command. Native launches drive the offline fixture CLIs through
 * the fake Herdr seam; Pi launches record the real launch command through
 * the same seam and settle through its Pi watch override. No model is
 * contacted and no Herdr resource is created.
 */
